  "language": "en",
  "text": "8.3 1 Most people think that rich people live lavish lifestyles. That is, they drive very expensive cars, eat in expensive restaurants, own a yacht or live in big houses. 2 In other words, having expensive things is not always a sign that someone is rich. 3 On the other hand, people who look rich, the people who drive the latest Ferrari or only wear designer clothes, may not actually be rich at all. 4 As a result, they don't spend too much and they don't get into debt. 5 There is no doubt that it's more difficult to save money if you are single. 6 So what can we learn from the wealthy? The answer is surprisingly simple.",
